I've been killed by a collision with the ceiling before now. I also used to
get killed by a pissed off deity, but these days it's just a holy wrath
instead. Heigh ho...

I've died from kicking a large box (hexagonal keyhole). Dontcha just love the
way that the type of lock gets included in the table?

Oh yes, then there's overexertion (our friend the incubus), a dumb move
(kicking a wall when somewhat low on HPs), sipping boiling water (from the
sink), an exploding large box (wallop!), exhaustion (not sure how I did that,
perhaps _that_ was the incubus), contaminated water (!), boiling potions (damn
scrolls of fire...), and an exploding wand (sounds painful! :-). 

And of course, the all time classic, being Crunched in the head by an iron
ball.

All these have been taken from our logfile - and only two people play Nethack
around here! I think we play too much...

